{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:02.52]Oh-oh-oh, woah, woah\n[00:08.92]It's fire\n[Chorus]\n[00:09.32]Huh, as we go on, we remember\n[00:19.64]All the times we spent together (Ooh, woah)\n[00:26.40]As our lives change (Ooh, woah), from whatever\n[00:31.94]We will still be (We will still), friends forever\n[Verse 1]\n[00:37.30]First off, to the girl in my math class, I'm rich\n[00:40.84]And you broke, bitch, I had the last laugh\n[00:43.26]And to the dumb nigga in my science lab\n[00:46.62]How'd it feel when we fought and you caught a jab? (Mayweather)\n[00:50.16]Fuck prom, fuck the teacher that was always talkin' on the intercom\n[00:53.30]And fuck the student that we thought was always gon' bring in a bomb\n[00:56.72]And all of the girls wild, them bitches was too foul\n[00:59.78]They all on my dick now\n[Chorus]\n[01:01.68]Huh, as we go on (As we go on), we remember (We remember)\n[01:09.20]All the times we (All the times), spent together (Ooh, woah)\n[01:15.88]As our lives change (Ooh, woah), from whatever\n[01:21.50]We will still be (We will still), friends forever\n[Verse 2]\n[01:26.66]Um, information leaker, had a crush on one of my teachers\n[01:29.64]Used to fantasize makin' love with her behind the bleachers\n[01:32.96]And to all the people who ain't like me, I ain't like me either\n[01:35.78]Half my class was havin' kids, guess we had that jungle fever\n[01:39.22]Uh, I was waitin' for my graduation (Uh-huh), growin' impatient (Uh-huh)\n[01:43.66]What I didn't know was this grown-up world (This grown-up world)\n[01:47.18]Was just school in a blown-up world (This blown-up world)\n[01:50.48]There's still gossip, there's still drama, there's still problems\n[01:52.80]There's a right and there's a wrong\n[01:54.34]There's still people that I think won't love me 'til I'm gone\n[01:57.48]Low-key miss the days walkin' 'round in my school halls\n[02:00.36]But now I got a bigger job, the world screamin' my songs\n[Chorus]\n[02:04.68]Huh, as we go on (As we go on), we remember (We remember)\n[02:11.14]All the times we (All the times), spent together (We were close)\n[02:17.52]As our lives change (As we change), from whatever (From what we know)\n[02:21.90]We will still be (We will still), friends forever (Enemies 'til the end)\n[Outro]\n[02:29.54]Lauren is such a bitch (I know, right?)\n[02:31.88]I don't even understand why guys like her, she's not even cute\n[02:34.94]She's not even pretty\n[02:35.90]Have you seen how much makeup she wears?\n[02:37.60]And by the way, she Facetunes her pictures so much (Oh my God, you are so right)\n[02:41.60]I honestly think she bought her followers\n[02:42.88]She barely gets any likes anyway (Um, she's honestly kinda sad)\n[02:46.06]And you wanna know the craziest part about all of it? (What?)\n[02:49.16]She doesn't even have any idea her boyfriend's been cheatin' on her this entire time (Huh?)","words":[[2.52,2.82,"Oh-oh-oh,"],[2.86,3.04,"woah,"],[8.68,8.88,"woah"],[8.92,8.98,"It's"],[9.02,9.28,"fire"],[9.32,13.34,"Huh,"],[13.4,13.62,"as"],[13.72,13.84,"we"],[14.08,14.16,"go"],[14.76,15.62,"on,"],[16.44,16.54,"we"],[16.8,18.68,"remember"],[19.64,19.78,"All"],[19.88,19.98,"the"],[20.26,20.96,"times"],[21.08,21.2,"we"],[22.5,22.86,"spent"],[22.96,24.4,"together"],[25.82,26.08,"(Ooh,"],[26.12,26.34,"woah)"],[26.4,26.44,"As"],[26.74,26.86,"our"],[26.9,27.1,"lives"],[27.24,28.18,"change"],[28.28,28.34,"(Ooh,"],[28.4,28.6,"woah),"],[28.8,29.04,"from"],[29.22,30.86,"whatever"],[31.94,32.04,"We"],[32.26,32.48,"will"],[32.58,32.84,"still"],[32.88,32.9,"be"],[32.94,32.96,"(We"],[33.0,33.22,"will"],[33.36,34.4,"still),"],[34.96,35.28,"friends"],[35.36,36.74,"forever"],[37.3,37.7,"First"],[37.82,37.98,"off,"],[38.08,38.16,"to"],[38.24,38.3,"the"],[38.46,38.86,"girl"],[38.94,38.98,"in"],[39.04,39.16,"my"],[39.24,39.48,"math"],[39.62,39.96,"class,"],[40.08,40.3,"I'm"],[40.46,40.78,"rich"],[40.84,40.92,"And"],[40.98,41.06,"you"],[41.18,41.44,"broke,"],[41.56,41.74,"bitch,"],[41.92,41.92,"I"],[41.96,42.1,"had"],[42.